# NaMiOS-Sen — bang mau RIENG cua Plasma desktoptheme (KHAC voi
# usr/share/color-schemes/NaMiOS.colors — file do la KColorScheme cho ung dung;
# file nay la 'colors' cua desktoptheme, duoc Plasma::Theme doc lam mau MAC DINH
# cho chu/icon/vien ve TREN NEN kinh mo cua chinh theme nay — vd PlasmaCore.Theme
# ComplementaryColorGroup ma panel/dock/kickoff/task-switcher mac dinh dung, bat
# ke color-scheme ung dung dang la gi). Nguon mau DUY NHAT =
# usr/share/namios-branding/logo/brand.json (v3 "Dong Son", 11/11/2026 — THAY
# "Sen Viet" v2 09/11/2026):
#   navy #092D4F = 9,45,79        | gold #DEA93E = 222,169,62 (ACCENT/Decoration)
#   vermilion #D64C3E = 214,76,62 | teal #278F8D = 39,143,141
#   ivory #FFF9EF = 255,249,239   | white #FFFFFF = 255,255,255
# (Ten thu muc/metadata Id "NaMiOS-Sen" GIU NGUYEN — chi doi GIA TRI mau trong
# file nay, KHONG doi ten theme/scheme de khong vo tham chieu KPackage cua cac
# wave khac, vd org.namios.sen Splash.qml.)
# (11/11/2026 — doi tu 5 sac do son/canh/dai cua "Sen Viet" v2 sang 1 mau
# vermilion duy nhat; doi 2 sac vang (vang_tam/vang_nuoc) sang 1 mau gold duy
# nhat; ForegroundActive/DecorationFocus/DecorationHover/ForegroundVisited
# doi tu do sang GOLD — vai tro "signature accent/highlight/focus" dung mau
# vang kim theo AUTHORITATIVE PALETTE Dong Son, KHONG con dung do nhu truoc.)
# Nen Window/Complementary/Header/View/Tooltip/Button = navy toi (092D4F) hoac
# "navy-subtle" #0A3257 (10,50,87 — sac do PHU TRO, navy sang hon ~ 1 nac, suy
# tu navy goc bang HSL +lightness, dung rieng cho vai BackgroundAlternate de
# giu lop sau/panel nhu ban cu, KHONG phai 1 trong 6 ma AUTHORITATIVE), chu
# ForegroundNormal = ivory (255,249,239) de doc duoc tren nen toi.
#
# ForegroundNegative dung "vermilion-light" #E48A81 (228,138,129) — sac do
# NHAT HON vermilion goc #D64C3E, suy rieng cho vai CHU tren NEN TOI (vermilion
# goc tren navy chi ~3.3:1, duoi chuan AA chu thuong; vermilion-light dat
# ~5.5:1 tren navy). Day la sac do PHU TRO, xem usr/share/namios/docs/BRAND.md.
#
# ForegroundInactive/ForegroundNeutral/ForegroundPositive la mau CHUC NANG
# (xam trung tinh/vang canh bao/xanh thanh cong) — KHONG thuoc brand.json, GIU
# NGUYEN nhu truoc khi doi bo nhan dien (brand.json chi la nguon mau DUY NHAT
# cho mau NHAN DIEN/logo, khong ap dung cho mau TRANG THAI chuc nang — quy tac
# da ghi trong doan verified_on_boot phia duoi, GIU LAI khong doi).
#
# verified_on_boot: NO — dung format .colors chuan (giong NaMiOS.colors da
# verify cau truc), nhung mau thuc te tren desktop theme chi xac nhan duoc khi
# boot Plasma that (xem docs/releases/boot-evidence).
#
# FIX 10/11/2026 (wave "desktop-theme designer senior", GIU LAI khong doi ở
# dot Dong Son nay): 6 nhom Button/Tooltip/View/Window/Complementary/Header
# truoc day dat ForegroundPositive = 229,99,101 (mau do brand) — TRUNG voi
# ForegroundActive/DecorationHover/ForegroundLink cua CHINH nhom do. Day la mot
# loi ngu nghia thuc: ForegroundPositive la mau PlasmaCore.Theme.positiveTextColor,
# duoc cac plasmoid he thong (pin/mang/battery, badge "xong") dung lam mau
# trang thai THANH CONG/DAT — dat no bang mau trung voi hover/lien ket se lam
# icon/chu "thanh cong" HIEN RA mau khac nghia, nguoi dung doc nham. Mau thay
# the = 89,199,152 (#59C798 — "status.success" nen TOI cua bo token UI ngu
# nghia rong hon, branding/design-system/tokens.json, DA kiem tra WCAG 2.2:
# 7.09:1 tren surface.base cu #122A3A, van >=6.86:1 tren cac nen navy moi dung
# trong file nay). Day la mau XANH LA DUY NHAT trong file nay — brand.json
# (nguon mau DUY NHAT cho BRAND/logo) KHONG co token xanh la nao (chi
# navy/gold/vermilion/teal/ivory/white), nen mau "thanh cong" phai lay tu lop
# token NGU NGHIA UI rong hon, khong phai tu brand.json — dung vi tri, khong vi
# pham "brand.json la nguon mau DUY NHAT" (quy tac do ap dung cho mau NHAN
# DIEN/logo, khong ap dung cho mau TRANG THAI chuc nang).
#
# verified_on_boot: NO — can boot Plasma that + mo mot plasmoid dung
# positiveTextColor (vd Battery & Brightness luc pin day/dang sac on dinh) de
# xac nhan bang mat mau xanh hien dung. Rollback: doi ca 6 dong
# ForegroundPositive ben duoi lai thanh "229,99,101" (gia tri truoc wave fix
# 10/11/2026) — doc lap voi moi thay doi khac trong file.

